                        "glosses": [
                            "A big, masculine wife; a dominating woman; virago."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "589b1b4f-76c2-4361-add2-0065cd3ffdfa",
                                "sense_id": "c2475536-767b-3456-a318-bc8b9e6349ac",
                                "text": "You archwives, strong as camels, take the high\nAnd overpowering hand against the male."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7cce35d1-2cdf-43e0-a0e8-fcc749092528",
                                "sense_id": "c2475536-767b-3456-a318-bc8b9e6349ac",
                                "text": "Lady Wallingford had been circulating defamatory libels against Buckingham, leading James to comment that Wallingford was like his father-in-law, 'altogether guided and overruled by an archwife'."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e3f4142d-3536-4d4f-a2eb-19b9e31c0dee",
                                "sense_id": "c2475536-767b-3456-a318-bc8b9e6349ac",
                                "text": "\"To pay homage to the World Harlot, the Mandrake Venus, the Archwife, the Ever-existing, who has been, is, and will be. […]\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6a62bd7b-4d2f-471e-a257-49ae159e308a",
                                "sense_id": "c2475536-767b-3456-a318-bc8b9e6349ac",
                                "text": "All the same, Master Kit, it looks like you're in a case of pickles – if her ma's half the archwife the postboy says she is! Seems to me you'll have to hang up your axe.'"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "948e09d8-b6ce-470d-a4e6-e108ed1ec7f4",
                                "sense_id": "c2475536-767b-3456-a318-bc8b9e6349ac",
                                "text": "Some poor fool might have been saved a lifetime of misery if the archwife had drowned in the ditch after all."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
